          zone = "Deadwind Pass",
          map = 1430,
          x = 47,
          y = 75.6,
        },
        { role = "inside", name = "Karazhan", instance = 532 },
      },
      detail = "Accepting this quest puts the Blackened Urn in your bags; from now on you are the raid's urn holder. In Karazhan go to the Master's Terrace via the side entrance (see the Master's Terrace step for the route; no boss needs to be dead, so raids commonly open the night with Nightbane), stand at the southern end and use the urn (item text: 'Summon Nightbane at the southern end of the Master's Terrace', 30 s cooldown) to summon Nightbane. He drops the Blazing Signet for the Serpentshrine attunement and the Faint Arcane Essence this quest wants. If the raid wipes and leaves combat he despawns and can be re-summoned, but once he is dead he is locked for that reset. Hand the essence to Alturus; the urn stays with you afterwards." },
