          map = 1948,
          x = 65.4,
          y = 90.1,
        },
      },
      detail = "Report to the Mistress of the Mines at the mine entrance south of the camp (65.4, 90.1) for 75 reputation. She and the Dragonmaw Foreman (64.0, 86.9) then offer two dailies worth 350 each: Picking Up The Pieces... (15 Nethermine Cargo crates lying in the mine tunnels) and Dragons are the Least of Our Problems (15 Nethermine Flayers and 5 Nethermine Ravagers inside the mine). Also in the mine: Crazed and Confused (Ronag the Slave Driver at 71.6, 87.6, 350), and the Murkblood Escape Plans item starting The Great Murkblood Revolt (350 reputation) and Seeker of Truth (interrogate a Murkblood Overseer, 500)." },
