      },
      detail = "Mor'ghor orders you to lead a Dragonmaw attack on your own Shattrath faction's outpost and gives you the Dragonmaw Flare Gun. Instead you warn them: Aldor players take Kill Them All! to Anchorite Ceyla at the Altar of Sha'tar (62.6, 28.4) and then Commander Arcus (to Commander Arcus at 62.4, 29.3); Scryer players take 11094 to Arcanist Thelis at the Sanctum of the Stars (56.2, 59.6) and then Commander Hobb (to Commander Hobb at 56.5, 58.6). The version offered depends on your Aldor or Scryer standing, and City of Light must be complete. 250 reputation." },
    { key = "commander_arcus", kind = "QUEST", title = "Report to Commander Arcus or Commander Hobb", optional = false, phases = { from = 3, to = false }, questId = 11100, altQuestIds = { 11095 }, questName = { ALDOR = "Commander Arcus", SCRYER = "Commander Hobb" },
