  unlocks = "Shattered Sun Offensive reputation to Exalted, Eldara Dawnrunner's vendor list (Sunward Crest, Dawnforged Defender, the four Shattered Sun Pendants, Alchemist Stone recipes, Tabard of the Shattered Sun) and the title of the Shattered Sun from A Magnanimous Benefactor.",
