      },
      detail = "Aldor players take Crisis at the Sunwell from Adyen the Lightwarden on the Aldor Rise; Scryer players take Duty Calls from Dathris Sunstriker on the Scryer's Tier. Both send you to Exarch Larethor at the Shattered Sun Staging Area on the western shore of the Isle of Quel'Danas (47.4, 30.7). Reach the isle by the flight masters in Ironforge or Silvermoon City (and later the Shattrath portal). 10 reputation. The Shattrath naaru General Tiras'alan also offers Enter, the Deceiver... (to Archmage Ne'thul, 25) as a second signpost." },
    { key = "magisters_terrace_chain", kind = "QUEST", title = "Magisters' Terrace, The Scryer's Scryer, Hard to Kill", optional = true, phases = { from = 5, to = false }, questId = 11488, questName = "Magisters' Terrace",
